blueprint:
  name: "Frank Energie - Smart Battery Manager v15.19 (Nacht-baseline tijdens Expensive Zone)"
  description: >
    **Nieuw v15.19:**
    - **Expensive Zone Discharging respecteert nu de nacht-baseline:** voorheen mocht Zone Discharging
      doorverkopen tot de Absolute Minimum SoC (bv. 15%), waarna je 's nachts vaak weer duur moest bijladen.
      Nu stopt het geforceerd exporteren zodra de SoC de "Morning Survival Target" nadert (bv. 35%) — je
      verkoopt dus alles wat je redelijkerwijs kunt missen tegen de hoge prijs, maar houdt genoeg over om de
      nacht door te komen zonder bij te hoeven laden. Zodra dat punt bereikt is, valt de automation automatisch
      terug op Smart Hold (SoC vasthouden) voor de rest van de zone.

    **Nieuw v15.18:**
    - **Slimme laadstart binnen de Cheap Zone:** in plaats van meteen bij de start van de goedkope zone vol
      vermogen uit het net te trekken, berekent de automation elke cyclus hoeveel kWh er nog nodig is tot
      100% SoC, trekt daar de verwachte resterende zonopbrengst (`effective_solar_rem`) van af, en bepaalt
      hoeveel uur dat tekort nog kost tegen je ingestelde laadvermogen. Time-Of-Use (geforceerd netladen)
      gaat pas aan zodra "nu + benodigde uren" de eindtijd van de Cheap Zone bereikt — daarvoor laadt de
      accu gewoon passief bij op PV. Vereist de nieuwe optionele input "Sensor: Cheap Zone Einde".

    **Nieuw v15.17:**
    - **Expensive Zone Discharging exporteert nu ook echt:** voorheen zette Zone Discharging alleen de
      Reserve-switch uit, waardoor de omvormer in Self-Use bleef ontladen (alleen huislast dekken, geen
      teruglevering). Nu wordt tijdens de hele Expensive Zone ook `feed_in_switch` (Feed-In Priority) actief
      gehouden, zodat overtollig batterijvermogen echt naar het net gepusht wordt voor rendement.

    **Nieuw v15.16 (Time-Of-Use fix voor geforceerd netladen):**
    - Op Solis-omvormers werkt "Allow Grid To Charge The Battery" alleen als de omvormer ook daadwerkelijk in
      **Time-Of-Use Mode** staat; anders blijft hij in Self-Use-modus hangen en laadt hij alleen naar rato van
      PV-opbrengst, ongeacht Target SoC of Reserve-switch. Een nieuwe optionele input schakelt Time-Of-Use Mode
      nu automatisch aan tijdens elke fase die echt wil bijladen (Boost, Emergency, Zone Charging, Smart
      Charging) en weer uit zodra dat niet meer nodig is (ontladen, Zone Discharging, Solar Bypass, Smart Hold).

    **Nieuw v15.15 (Zone-modus):**
    - **Cheap/Expensive Zone laden & ontladen:** optioneel te koppelen aan `binary_sensor.frank_cheap_period` en
      `binary_sensor.frank_expensive_period` uit de Frank Quarter Prices integratie. Zolang de goedkope zone
      actief is, wordt Target SoC op 100% gezet en de Reserve-switch aangezet (de omvormer laadt dan zelf op
      vol vermogen met PV+grid gecombineerd). Zolang de dure zone actief is, wordt de Reserve-switch uitgezet
      zodat de batterij ontlaadt — met behoud van de Absolute Minimum SoC-bodem.
    - **Zone heeft voorrang** boven de Smart-prijsdrempel-logica; buiten de zones (of als je de sensoren leeg
      laat) valt de automation gewoon terug op de bestaande Smart Charging/Discharging-strategie.
    - Laat de twee zone-sensoren leeg om Zone-modus volledig uit te schakelen.

    **Fix v15.14 (Frank Quarter Prices compatibiliteit):**
    - **Regex-parser verwijderd:** de oude regex die Python `datetime.datetime(...)`-reprs verwachtte werkte niet
      met de `ha-frank-quarter-prices` integratie (ISO-datumtijden, `total_price_eur_kwh`-veld). De dagreeks
      wordt nu rechtstreeks uit de `prices`-attributen van `sensor.frank_prices_today` / `_tomorrow` gelezen.
    - **Losse "vandaag"/"morgen" sensoren:** deze integratie splitst de dagreeks over twee entiteiten in
      plaats van één. Daarvoor zijn twee nieuwe inputs toegevoegd.
    - **Juiste "huidige prijs"-sensor:** `frank_price_sensor` moet nu wijzen naar `sensor.frank_current_price`
      (EUR/kWh), niet naar `sensor.frank_prices_today` (dat is een blokken-teller, geen prijs — dit veroorzaakte
      de "EUR96.0"-melding).
    - **Kale marktprijs via attribuut:** de "raw market price"-sensor bestaat niet los in deze integratie; de
      kale marktprijs wordt nu gelezen uit het `market_price`-attribuut van `sensor.frank_current_return_price`.

    Bevat ook (ongewijzigd t.o.v. v15.13): Type-Cast Fix, Solar-Aware Load Correction, Manual Bypass Override,
    Drietraps Negative Guard, Solar Calibration, EEPROM Guard.

    STRATEGY: Predictive Profit, Solar Optimization & Hardware Protection.
  domain: automation
  input:
    language:
      name: "Language / Taal"
      default: "nl"
      selector:
        select:
          options:
            - label: "English"
              value: "en"
            - label: "Nederlands"
              value: "nl"

    battery_reserve_switch:
      name: "Switch: Reserve Mode (Force Charge/Hold)"
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: switch
    feed_in_switch:
      name: "Switch: Feed-In Priority [OPTIONEEL]"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: switch
    battery_soc_sensor:
      name: "Sensor: Battery SoC"
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
          device_class: battery
    target_soc_number:
      name: "Entity: Target SoC"
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: number
    frank_price_sensor:
      name: "Sensor: Frank Energy Huidige Prijs (EUR/kWh)"
      description: >-
        Gebruik sensor.frank_current_price van de 'Frank Quarter Prices' integratie. NIET
        sensor.frank_prices_today gebruiken: die geeft het AANTAL prijsblokken terug (bv. 96), geen prijs.
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
    frank_prices_today_sensor:
      name: "Sensor: Frank Prijzen Vandaag (met 'prices' attribuut)"
      description: "sensor.frank_prices_today - bevat de volledige kwartierreeks van vandaag in het 'prices'-attribuut."
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
    frank_prices_tomorrow_sensor:
      name: "Sensor: Frank Prijzen Morgen (met 'prices' attribuut) [OPTIONEEL]"
      description: >-
        sensor.frank_prices_tomorrow - is 's ochtends en vroeg in de middag 'unavailable' totdat Frank de
        prijzen publiceert (meestal tussen 13:00-14:00). Dat is normaal en de automation vangt dit op.
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
    frank_cheap_period_sensor:
      name: "Binary Sensor: Frank Cheap Period (Zone-modus) [OPTIONEEL]"
      description: >-
        binary_sensor.frank_cheap_period - staat 'on' zolang we nu in de goedkope prijszone van vandaag zitten.
        Tijdens deze zone wordt Target SoC op 100% gezet en de Reserve-switch aangezet (vol vermogen laden,
        PV+grid gecombineerd). Laat leeg om Zone-modus uit te schakelen.
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: binary_sensor
    frank_expensive_period_sensor:
      name: "Binary Sensor: Frank Expensive Period (Zone-modus) [OPTIONEEL]"
      description: >-
        binary_sensor.frank_expensive_period - staat 'on' zolang we nu in de dure prijszone van vandaag zitten.
        Tijdens deze zone wordt de Reserve-switch uitgezet zodat de batterij ontlaadt (met behoud van de
        Absolute Minimum SoC). Laat leeg om Zone-modus uit te schakelen.
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: binary_sensor
    time_of_use_switch:
      name: "Switch: Solis Time-Of-Use Mode [OPTIONEEL]"
      description: >-
        switch.pv_omvormer_time_of_use (of vergelijkbaar). Nodig zodra 'Allow Grid To Charge The Battery' is
        ingeschakeld maar de omvormer toch alleen op PV blijft laden: Solis negeert geforceerd netladen zolang
        deze niet aan staat. Wordt automatisch aan/uit gezet samen met de laadfases. Laat leeg als jouw
        omvormer dit niet nodig heeft.
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: switch
    frank_cheap_zone_end_sensor:
      name: "Sensor: Frank Cheap Zone Einde [OPTIONEEL]"
      description: >-
        sensor.frank_cheap_zone_end_today - tijdstip waarop de goedkope zone vandaag eindigt. Nodig om te
        berekenen wanneer geforceerd netladen ten laatste moet starten. Laat leeg om altijd meteen bij het
        begin van de zone vol vermogen te laden (oud gedrag).
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
    last_price_helper:
      name: "Helper: Last Purchase Price"
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: input_number
    sun_entity:
      name: "Sensor: Sun"
      default: "sun.sun"
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sun

    frank_return_price_sensor:
      name: "Sensor: Frank Energy Terugleverprijs [OPTIONEEL]"
      description: >-
        sensor.frank_current_return_price - de kale marktprijs (zonder belasting) wordt gelezen uit het
        'market_price'-attribuut van deze sensor. Wordt gebruikt om negatieve marktprijzen te detecteren
        (Offgrid/Backflow-blok).
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
    offgrid_switch:
      name: "Switch: Offgrid Mode [OPTIONEEL]"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: switch
    backflow_power_entity:
      name: "Entity: Backflow Power Limit (Watt) [OPTIONEEL]"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: number
    normal_backflow_limit:
      name: "Normal Backflow Limit (Watt)"
      default: 5000
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0
          max: 20000
          step: 100

    solar_forecast_remaining_today:
      name: "Sensor: Solar Forecast Remaining Today (kWh) [OPTIONEEL]"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
    p1_power_sensor:
      name: "Sensor: P1 Grid Import (Watt)"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
          device_class: power
    battery_power_sensor:
      name: "Sensor: Battery Charging Power (Watt)"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
          device_class: power

    sensor_load_night:
      name: "Sensor: Night Load (kW) [OPTIONEEL]"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: ["sensor", "input_number"]
    fallback_load_night:
      name: "Fallback: Night Load (00:00 - 06:00) in kW"
      default: 0.3
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0.0
          max: 10.0
          step: 0.1

    sensor_load_morning:
      name: "Sensor: Morning Load (kW) [OPTIONEEL]"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: ["sensor", "input_number"]
    fallback_load_morning:
      name: "Fallback: Morning Load (06:00 - 09:00) in kW"
      default: 1.5
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0.0
          max: 10.0
          step: 0.1

    sensor_load_day:
      name: "Sensor: Day Load (kW) [OPTIONEEL]"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: ["sensor", "input_number"]
    fallback_load_day:
      name: "Fallback: Day Load (09:00 - 17:00) in kW"
      default: 0.5
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0.0
          max: 10.0
          step: 0.1

    sensor_load_evening:
      name: "Sensor: Evening Load (kW) [OPTIONEEL]"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: ["sensor", "input_number"]
    fallback_load_evening:
      name: "Fallback: Evening Load (17:00 - 00:00) in kW"
      default: 2.0
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0.0
          max: 10.0
          step: 0.1

    profit_lock_step:
      name: "Smart Hold: Profit Lock Step (%)"
      default: 5
      selector:
        number:
          min: 1
          max: 20
          unit_of_measurement: "%"
    morning_survival_soc:
      name: "Morning Survival Target (%)"
      default: 35
      selector:
        number:
          min: 10
          max: 80
          unit_of_measurement: "%"
    peak_hours_count:
      name: "Peak Analysis Window"
      default: 3
      selector:
        number:
          min: 1
          max: 6
    buffer_discount_percentage:
      name: "Buffer Discount (%)"
      default: 40
      selector:
        number:
          min: 10
          max: 90
          unit_of_measurement: "%"
    min_discharge_margin:
      name: "Min. Discharge Profit (%)"
      default: 20
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0
          max: 100
          unit_of_measurement: "%"

    min_base_soc:
      name: "Absolute Minimum SoC (%)"
      default: 15
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0
          max: 100
          unit_of_measurement: "%"

    boost_switch:
      name: "Switch: Manual Boost"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: input_boolean
    disable_bypass_switch:
      name: "Switch: Disable Solar Bypass (Force Sun Charge) [OPTIONEEL]"
      default: []
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: ["input_boolean", "switch"]
    notify_device:
      name: "Notification Device"
      default: []
      selector:
        device:
          integration: mobile_app

    target_soc_winter:
      name: "Target SoC (Winter)"
      default: 90
      selector:
        number:
          min: 10
          max: 100
    target_soc_summer:
      name: "Target SoC (Summer)"
      default: 30
      selector:
        number:
          min: 10
          max: 100
    summer_solar_threshold:
      name: "Summer Solar Threshold (kWh)"
      default: 15
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0
          max: 100

    solar_forecast_today:
      name: "Sensor: Solar Forecast Today"
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
    solar_forecast_tomorrow:
      name: "Sensor: Solar Forecast Tomorrow"
      selector:
        entity:
          domain: sensor
    battery_capacity_kwh:
      name: "Battery Capacity (kWh)"
      default: 10
      selector:
        number:
          min: 1
          max: 100
          step: 0.1
    charge_power_kw:
      name: "Charge Speed (kW)"
      default: 3.0
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0.1
          max: 22
          step: 0.1
    safety_factor:
      name: "BMS Safety Factor"
      default: 1.5
      selector:
        number:
          min: 1.0
          max: 4.0
          step: 0.1
    max_price_cap:
      name: "Absolute Max Price (EUR)"
      default: 0.35
      selector:
        number:
          min: 0
          max: 2.0
          step: 0.01

    report_time_evening:
      name: "Report Time (Evening)"
      default: "21:30:00"
      selector:
        time:
    report_time_morning:
      name: "Report Time (Morning)"
      default: "08:00:00"
      selector:
        time:

trigger_variables:
  boost_entity: !input boost_switch
  cheap_zone_entity: !input frank_cheap_period_sensor
  expensive_zone_entity: !input frank_expensive_period_sensor

trigger:
  - platform: time_pattern
    minutes: "/5"
    id: "timer"
  - platform: time
    at: !input report_time_evening
    id: "report"
  - platform: time
    at: !input report_time_morning
    id: "report"
  - platform: state
    entity_id: !input frank_price_sensor
    id: "price_change"
  - platform: state
    entity_id: !input battery_soc_sensor
    id: "soc_change"
  - platform: template
    value_template: "{{ boost_entity != [] and is_state(boost_entity, 'on') }}"
    id: "boost"
  - platform: template
    value_template: >-
      {{ (cheap_zone_entity != [] and is_state(cheap_zone_entity, 'on')) ~ '|' ~
         (expensive_zone_entity != [] and is_state(expensive_zone_entity, 'on')) }}
    id: "zone_change"

action:
  - condition: template
    value_template: >-
      {% if trigger is defined and trigger.platform == 'state' %}
        {{ trigger.to_state.state != trigger.from_state.state }}
      {% else %}
        true
      {% endif %}

  - variables:
      language: !input language
      conf_soc_sensor: !input battery_soc_sensor
      conf_price_sensor: !input frank_price_sensor
      conf_prices_today: !input frank_prices_today_sensor
      conf_prices_tomorrow: !input frank_prices_tomorrow_sensor
      conf_cheap_period: !input frank_cheap_period_sensor
      conf_expensive_period: !input frank_expensive_period_sensor
      conf_cheap_zone_end: !input frank_cheap_zone_end_sensor
      conf_tou: !input time_of_use_switch
      conf_last_price: !input last_price_helper
      conf_boost: !input boost_switch
      conf_disable_bypass: !input disable_bypass_switch
      conf_notify: !input notify_device
      conf_target_num: !input target_soc_number
      conf_switch: !input battery_reserve_switch
      conf_feed_in: !input feed_in_switch
      conf_sun: !input sun_entity
      conf_p1: !input p1_power_sensor
      conf_bat_pow: !input battery_power_sensor
      conf_return_price: !input frank_return_price_sensor
      conf_offgrid: !input offgrid_switch
      conf_backflow: !input backflow_power_entity
      p_normal_backflow: !input normal_backflow_limit
      conf_solar_rem: !input solar_forecast_remaining_today
      conf_load_night: !input sensor_load_night
      fallback_night: !input fallback_load_night
      conf_load_morning: !input sensor_load_morning
      fallback_morning: !input fallback_load_morning
      conf_load_day: !input sensor_load_day
      fallback_day: !input fallback_load_day
      conf_load_evening: !input sensor_load_evening
      fallback_evening: !input fallback_load_evening
      p_lock_step: !input profit_lock_step
      p_morning_soc: !input morning_survival_soc
      p_peak_count: !input peak_hours_count
      p_buffer_disc: !input buffer_discount_percentage
      p_min_discharge: !input min_discharge_margin
      p_bat_cap: !input battery_capacity_kwh
      p_charge_kw: !input charge_power_kw
      p_safety: !input safety_factor
      p_max_cap: !input max_price_cap
      p_min_base_soc: !input min_base_soc
      t_winter: !input target_soc_winter
      t_summer: !input target_soc_summer
      t_solar_th: !input summer_solar_threshold
      s_sol_today: !input solar_forecast_today
      s_sol_tom: !input solar_forecast_tomorrow

  - variables:
      current_soc: "{{ states(conf_soc_sensor) | float(0) }}"
      last_paid_price: "{{ states(conf_last_price) | float(0) }}"
      is_boost_active: "{{ conf_boost != [] and is_state(conf_boost, 'on') }}"
      has_notify_device: "{{ conf_notify != [] }}"
      now_ts: "{{ as_timestamp(now()) }}"
      is_daytime: "{{ is_state(conf_sun, 'above_horizon') }}"
      raw_price_state: "{{ states(conf_price_sensor) }}"
      current_price: >-
        {% if raw_price_state in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ last_paid_price | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ raw_price_state | float(last_paid_price | float(0)) }}
        {% endif %}
      current_raw_price: >-
        {% set mp = state_attr(conf_return_price, 'market_price') if conf_return_price != [] else none %}
        {% if mp is not none %}
          {{ mp | float(0.0) }}
        {% else %}
          0.0
        {% endif %}
      is_zero_export_window: >-
        {% if conf_return_price != [] %}
          {{ (current_raw_price | float(0)) < 0.0 and (current_price | float(0)) >= 0.0 }}
        {% else %}
          False
        {% endif %}
      is_cheap_zone: "{{ conf_cheap_period != [] and is_state(conf_cheap_period, 'on') }}"
      is_expensive_zone: "{{ conf_expensive_period != [] and is_state(conf_expensive_period, 'on') }}"
      is_bypass_disabled: >-
        {% if conf_disable_bypass != [] and is_state(conf_disable_bypass, 'on') and (current_soc | float(0)) < 95 %}
          True
        {% else %}
          False
        {% endif %}
      val_night: >-
        {% if conf_load_night != [] and states(conf_load_night) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ states(conf_load_night) | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ fallback_night | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      val_morning: >-
        {% if conf_load_morning != [] and states(conf_load_morning) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ states(conf_load_morning) | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ fallback_morning | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      val_day: >-
        {% if conf_load_day != [] and states(conf_load_day) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ states(conf_load_day) | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ fallback_day | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      val_evening: >-
        {% if conf_load_evening != [] and states(conf_load_evening) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ states(conf_load_evening) | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ fallback_evening | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      current_load_kw: >-
        {% set h = now().hour %}
        {% if h < 6 %} {{ val_night | float(0) }}
        {% elif h < 9 %} {{ val_morning | float(0) }}
        {% elif h < 17 %} {{ val_day | float(0) }}
        {% else %} {{ val_evening | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}

  - variables:
      current_charging_cost: >-
        {% set is_active = is_state(conf_switch, 'on') %}
        {% if conf_p1 != [] and conf_bat_pow != [] %}
          {% set grid_w = states(conf_p1) | float(0) %}
          {% set bat_w = states(conf_bat_pow) | float(0) %}
          {% if bat_w > 10 %}
            {% set grid_import = [grid_w, 0] | max %}
            {% set ratio = [(grid_import / bat_w), 1.0] | min %}
            {{ (current_price | float(0)) * ratio }}
          {% else %}
            {{ current_price | float(0) if is_active else 0.0 }}
          {% endif %}
        {% else %}
          {{ current_price | float(0) if is_active else 0.0 }}
        {% endif %}

  - choose:
      - conditions:
          - condition: trigger
            id: "soc_change"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ trigger.to_state.state | float(0) > trigger.from_state.state | float(0) }}"
        sequence:
          - service: input_number.set_value
            target: {entity_id: !input last_price_helper}
            data:
              value: >-
                {% set old_soc = trigger.from_state.state | float(0) %}
                {% set new_soc = trigger.to_state.state | float(0) %}
                {% set diff = new_soc - old_soc %}
                {% set old_price = last_paid_price | float(0) %}
                {% set cost = current_charging_cost | float(current_price | float(0)) %}
                {% if not is_daytime and cost == 0 %}
                  {{ old_price }}
                {% else %}
                  {% if new_soc > 0 %}
                    {{ (((old_soc * old_price) + (diff * cost)) / new_soc) | round(4) }}
                  {% else %}
                    {{ old_price }}
                  {% endif %}
                {% endif %}
          - stop: "Prijs succesvol geupdate via SOC stijging."

  - variables:
      raw_today: "{{ state_attr(conf_prices_today, 'prices') }}"
      raw_tomorrow: >-
        {{ state_attr(conf_prices_tomorrow, 'prices') if conf_prices_tomorrow != [] else [] }}
      prices_json: >-
        {% set ns = namespace(items=[]) %}
        {% for item in (raw_today or []) %}
          {% set ts_val = as_timestamp(item.from, 0) %}
          {% if ts_val %}
            {% set ns.items = ns.items + [{
              "local_hour": item.from[11:13] | int(0),
              "day_str": "Vandaag",
              "ts": ts_val,
              "price": item.total_price_eur_kwh | float(0)
            }] %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% for item in (raw_tomorrow or []) %}
          {% set ts_val = as_timestamp(item.from, 0) %}
          {% if ts_val %}
            {% set ns.items = ns.items + [{
              "local_hour": item.from[11:13] | int(0),
